  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Hanover, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Business   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n         Agendas & Minutes \n         Emergency Alerts \n         Calendar \n         Forms \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\n\t\t\tLast Content Update:\r\n\t\t\t  Tuesday, February 17, 2026 \r\nThe Town Clerk's office is open to the general public Monday through Friday, 8:30 am to 4:30 pm. We ask to complete Marriage Licenses and Motor Vehicle Registrations prior to 4:00 pm.  \nThe Town Clerk's office accepts cash or check with no additional fee. Credit or Debit payments are also accepted with a 2.99% or $2.50 minimum convenience fee.  \nINCREASE IN STATE MOTOR VEHICLE FEES \nEffective January 1, 2026, residents renewing, transferring, or obtaining motor vehicle registrations on a new vehicle, trailer, or motorcycle will notice an increase in the State portion of their transaction(s). These changes are pursuant to 2025 House Bill 2 (HB2). \nLocal municipal fees will not be increasing, so only the state portion of your total registration cost will be affected.  \nClick  here  for more information \nRelated Documents \r\nVital Record Request Forms \r\nRequest a Copy of a Birth Certificate (PDF) \r\nRequest a Copy of a Death Certificate (PDF) \r\nRequest a Copy of a Divorce Decree (PDF) \r\nRequest a Copy of a Marriage Certificate (PDF) \r\nDog Licensing  \r\nDog License Registration Form \r\nVendor Permits \r\nApplication for Vendor Permit (PDF) \r\nMap of Vendor Spaces (PDF) \r\nStreet Vendor Ordinance (PDF) \r\nContact Us! \r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail the Town Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 41 South Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Hanover ,  NH   03755 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t P.O. Box 483 \n\t\t\t\t\t Hanover ,  NH   03755 \r\nPhone:  603-640-3202 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tTracy Walsh\r\nTown Clerk \r\ntracy.walsh@hanovernh.org  \r\nPhone:  603-640-3200 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tRoberta Hitchcock\r\nDeputy Town Clerk \r\nEmail  \r\nPhone:  603-640-3291 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tGary Langlois\r\nAssistant Town Clerk and Deputy Tax Collector \r\nGary.Langlois@Hanovernh.org  \r\nPhone:  603-640-3202 \r\n\t\t\t Elections & Voting Information \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records: Copies of Birth, Death, Marriage and Divorce Certificates \r\n\t\t\t Water/Sewer Utility Billing \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing Information \r\n\t\t\t Notary Services \r\n\t\t\t Vendor Permits \r\n\t\t\t Town Charter \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t GIS \r\n\t\t\t Pay Online \r\n\t\t\t Selectboard Agendas and Meeting Packets \r\n\t\t\t Sign Up \r\n\t\t\t Parking \r\nHanover Town Hall \r\nP.O. Box 483  \n41 South Main Street \nHanover, NH 03755 \nMonday through Friday \n8:30 am to 4:30 pm \nPhone:  603-643- 4123 \nEmail Us \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Parking \n         Building Code \n         Career Opportunities \n         Animal Control \n         Public Works \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n         Employee Portal \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n     Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
